    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. _relativize_ir_paths (cli.py:13105) runs before run_all_linkers (cli.py:13237); memberlist_paths (go_memberlist.py:160) holds absolute paths, so `sym.path in memberlist_paths` (:170) never matches and the linker returns early; :210 has the same mismatch. hypergumbo survey on a memberlist fixture: no dispatches_to, run record edges_emitted 0. Unit tests use absolute symbol paths. go_cobra.py:206 relativizes correctly. Same shape as WI-fukaf and WI-gimis. v10 (new)."  # 8ebd
