  message: "Fixed in PR #2090. go_memberlist.py resolves a repo-relative Symbol.path against ctx.repo_root (_discovered_path) in both the delegate filter and the memberlist_files lookup. Live repro: hypergumbo survey on a memberlist repo emits Start -> Delegate.NotifyMsg, and the linker's run record shows edges_emitted 1 (was 0 in surveys; only unit tests with absolute paths saw edges). Test: TestRepoRelativeSymbolPaths."  # b5e7
